Package: ccs-serveur
Source: ccs
Version: 0.10.2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: mawena <gamligocharles@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: 488
Depends: ccs (= 0.10.2), python3-aiohttp, python3-pyotp, python3-qrcode, libpam0g, adduser, systemd
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: CCS server: drive Claude Code from a browser, phone or terminal
 Runs CCS on a server (VPS): a web interface (responsive, for phones) and an
 API for the desktop application and `ccs tui`. Users log in with their
 Ubuntu account (PAM, members of the "ccs" group, never root) and a
 mandatory TOTP code. Services: ccs-auth (root, minimal), ccs-web
 (unprivileged, 127.0.0.1:8420, behind a reverse proxy) and one bridge per
 logged-in user.
